      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَدَّامٌ</span></b>  One <i>who does much service;</i> (TA in the
present art.;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَدُومٌ</span></b> . (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عقرب</span>.)
And also applied to <i>A</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَادِم</span> [q. v.]. (TA in the
present art. [It is commonly used in the latter
sense in the present day: fem. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>.])

